# 20Min.fr Smart Contract Audit Report
## Overview
This folder contains a historical public smart contract audit report
completed by Softstack for 20Min.fr and Capsule Corp Labs.
## Audit Information
Project: 20Min.fr
Audit type: Smart contract audit
Repository category: Historical public audit archive
Public report: Available in this folder
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion
