## Summary
This report is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It
provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work and
should be read as an archive reference rather than a current project
endorsement.
Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smartcontract-audit/
